M-Extension-Server v1.0.5.0 is distributed under the Mozilla Public
License 2.0. Hibiki's modified source files are kept in this directory
and applied to the exact upstream commit recorded in UPSTREAM.

Significant Hibiki modifications:

- loopback-only listener;
- mandatory random Bearer authentication for all routes;
- authenticated APK inspection using apksig;
- authenticated source image and source data clearing routes;
- Hibiki bridge capability identifier.

Corresponding Source for shipped binaries is this overlay plus the upstream
commit identified in UPSTREAM. Build scripts reproduce the combined source.
